{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The love of your life is waiting for you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Do you dare to live a unique story? Here you will find couples of all kinds: men, women and beyond your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to fall in love, create your path and discover how each step can change your destiny. Your story begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A game that transforms with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this visual novel, every choice you make will be a reflection of you. The story not only moves forward, but changes its tone, its essence and even its destiny according to the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you prefer a touch of mystery and darkness, or are you looking for laughter and unforgettable moments? This game is tailored to you, offering you a completely personalized experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the very first moment, you are in charge of the adventure, are you ready to discover how far your choices will take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591060/extras/2477ca9d7eb42aeff453defe25a25c95.avif?t=1761912279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591060/extras_big/2477ca9d7eb42aeff453defe25a25c95.avif?t=1761912279 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is in Early Access,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > offering you the first of many stories we have planned. In the future, more than <strong>15 original stories</strong> await you, each with its own style and special touches that will make you want to explore them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opinion is key for us. If you decide to join this adventure, don't forget to leave a review about your experience. We will read every comment and work constantly to improve and offer you an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being part of this initial stage, your journey is just beginning, and we want you to grow with us!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"NO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/633bde40478ada6cbe6c865cde8c4d936854d8fa.jpg"},{"name":"You fell in love with a cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/994399ca9c3f2e5708e45720dded51a2a59bf7ff.jpg"},{"name":"You are the real villain ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/88bf555a4b58a2a77a34f3f67fe409f4821c8b72.jpg"},{"name":"Reference333","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/8b069f5c4a4864bed36ffbfe5e8300111862e6ea.jpg"},{"name":"You die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/804996ff2dcecd3a07c679b90963cbaa259e042e.jpg"},{"name":"Yina rejected you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/1964bdd5127e91c94e6ce7cbf7d51b9e9e07320c.jpg"},{"name":"Friendzone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/92ed11f12ac03a0e8676c324933f10319d1bc441.jpg"},{"name":"you are a heartbreaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/888682a9133a3636906eeee2fb2afab40f72498e.jpg"},{"name":"you are a hater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/b66eb4f4d9b38a4311d6744d17525a6d62f8e26c.jpg"},{"name":"Yinarimi became depressed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591060/f6673b5a1959d0024febd741f58ce9414e7a3673.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/